00:03:34.532 --> 00:03:36.403
<v Host>It means an adventure.

00:03:37.003 --> 00:03:45.596
<v Slow>前のゲームの楽しさはそのままで、もっと遊びやすくなったということです。

00:03:46.395 --> 00:03:50.740
<v Host>It keeps the fun of the old game, but it is now easier to play.

00:03:51.340 --> 00:03:53.740
