00:03:54.139 --> 00:03:57.259
<v Host>It means just as it is, without changing.

00:03:57.860 --> 00:04:06.116
<v Slow>発売から4日間で、世界で520万本以上売れました。

00:04:06.915 --> 00:04:12.484
<v Host>In the first four days, it sold more than five point two million copies worldwide.

00:04:13.084 --> 00:04:18.819
<v Slow>日本では、81万本が売れました。

00:04:19.620 --> 00:04:23.819
<v Host>In Japan, eight hundred ten thousand copies were sold.

00:04:24.420 --> 00:04:37.548
<v Slow>任天堂によると、スイッチ2のゲームで、最初の4日間にこんなに売れたのは、今までで一番だということです。

00:04:38.348 --> 00:04:43.699
<v Host>Nintendo says no Switch Two game has ever sold this many in its first four days.

00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:47.444
<v Vocab>今までで一番

00:04:47.843 --> 00:04:50.939
<v Host>It means the most ever, the best so far.

